#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:30
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} wrote down the secret code\n"
"on the door.\p"
"“TRICK MASTER is cool.”\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"The lock clicked open!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在门上写下了暗号。\p"
"“机关大王真帅气。”\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"咔嚓一声，锁打开了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_CoraIntro"
msgid ""
"It's too much bother to think this out.\n"
"I only wanted to battle!$"
msgstr ""
"动脑筋想这些太麻烦了。\n"
"我只是想对战而已！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_CoraDefeat"
msgid ""
"Even though I lost, I still like battling\n"
"the best!$"
msgstr "虽然输了，但我还是最喜欢对战了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:45
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_CoraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't you agree? You would go\n"
"anywhere if TRAINERS were there.$"
msgstr ""
"你也这么觉得吧？\n"
"只要有训练家在，去哪里都行。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:49
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_YujiIntro"
msgid ""
"Heh! Boulders like this, I can brush\n"
"aside with one finger!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿！这种大石头，\n"
"我用一根手指就能推开！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_YujiDefeat"
msgid ""
"I can push boulders, but I can't solve\n"
"the puzzle…$"
msgstr "我推得动大石头，却解不开谜题……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:57
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_YujiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It's not good enough to be brawny…\n"
"You have to use your head. Be brainy!$"
msgstr ""
"光有力气是不够的……\n"
"还得动动脑子。要聪明一点！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_PaulaIntro"
msgid ""
"The TRICK HOUSE is getting trickier,\n"
"isn't it?$"
msgstr "机关屋越来越难了，对吧？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_PaulaDefeat"
msgid "Aaak!$"
msgstr "啊啊啊！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4/scripts.inc:68
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_PaulaPostBattle"
msgid "Has anyone made it to the end?$"
msgstr "有人走到过终点吗？$"
